      {
        "id": 175351,
        "name": "hstein3",
        "username": "hstein3",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/hstein3/{size}/2159_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-06T13:42:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dang. I thought I'd managed to survive the initial onslaught. My heroes were all in low single digits, but Tempest had Cleansing Rain out, so I thought, as long as I can stall, it'll all be okay. I even had the Infrared Eyepiece in play, so I thought I was well on my way to controlling the board.</p>\n<p>I forgot about the Translocator.</p>\n<p>Voss played a Gene-bound Guard. Fine. But that spurred another play . . . the TCF Stalwart. Suddenly I wished I'd played Sub-Zero Atmosphere already (not that I could have killed it in one round.) Bam, most of my heroes down.</p>\n<p>Oh well, who needs mints anyhow? They'll be devalued from all these collectors anyhow.&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"></p>",
        "post_number": 25,
        "post_type": 1,
